WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
What if an instruction changes what you notice?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A classic color-word task lets reading compete with the color you need to name.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In selected, highly suggestible volunteers, the spoken suggestion sometimes changed the result.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A 2025 study tested suggestion and induction separately. Both mattered in that specific attention task.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
That does not establish the effects of any commercial recording—or a guaranteed benefit.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Follow the experiment, check the sources, and decide what the evidence actually says.
